      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but i've read so many things online saying oregano oil is basically a natural antibiotic and can kill bacteria the same way. i just don't want to deal with all the side effects of prescription meds or the cost right now. if i took like 1000mg of oregano oil every few hours for a few days, do you think that would be enough to knock it out? i just want to try this before i commit to a doctor's visit.",
